1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Check engine light comes and goes,
and you catch a faint fuel smell near the gas cap?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Idle stumbles a little,
especially right after you fill up.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
One clue: a stuck EVAP purge valve.
It controls fuel vapor flow into the engine.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Stuck open or closed, it can throw off
your idle and trip that light.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Don't guess which part it is.
A smoke test can help find the leak.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking before it fails emissions testing.
Stop by and we'll take a look. Nick's Tire & Auto.
